L721: # **Additional File 2**
L722: **The effect of vitamin C on bronchoconstriction and respiratory symptoms**
L723: **caused by exercise: a review and statistical analysis**
L724: **Harri Hemilä**
L725: **Published in AACI**
L726: [http://www.aacijournal.com/](http://www.aacijournal.com/)
L727: ## This file describes the Methods for Fig. 3 (0 min) and shows Figs. 3E and 3F
L728: **Nov 18, 2014**
L729: **Harri Hemilä**
L730: Department of Public Health
L731: University of Helsinki
L732: Helsinki, Finland
L733: [harri.hemila@helsinki.fi](mailto:harri.hemila@helsinki.fi)
L734: [http://www.mv.helsinki.fi/home/hemila/](http://www.mv.helsinki.fi/home/hemila/)
L735: [http://www.mv.helsinki.fi/home/hemila/vitc_asthma.htm](http://www.mv.helsinki.fi/home/hemila/vitc_asthma.htm) (papers on vitamin C and asthma)
L736: **This is a secondary analysis of the Schachter and Schlesinger (1982) study [S&S].**
L737: PubMed record of S&S:
L738: [http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/7114587](http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/7114587)
L739: **For the purpose of checking,**
L740: **S&S Table II (0 min after exercise) and Table V (baseline) are available at:**
L741: [http://www.mv.helsinki.fi/home/hemila/A/Schachter.htm](http://www.mv.helsinki.fi/home/hemila/A/Schachter.htm)
